  <h2>Time Investment and What Comes Next</h2>

  <p>Here's the full beginner path, based on OLSP's Skill Center structure:</p>

  <table>
    <tr><th>Course</th><th>Duration</th><th>Level</th><th>When to Take It</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Getting Started</td><td>07:56</td><td>Megalink</td><td>Immediately</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Getting Started with the Megalink</td><td>42:52</td><td>Megalink</td><td>Same day</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Facebook 101</td><td>2:31:37</td><td>Megalink</td><td>Week 1</td></tr>
    <tr><td>30 Day Challenge</td><td>25:58:41</td><td>Megalink</td><td>Month 1</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Live sessions (Tue/Thu/Sat)</td><td>60 min each</td><td>All levels</td><td>Ongoing</td></tr>
  </table>

  <p>The full beginner curriculum at the Megalink level — entirely available for the $7 entry fee — adds up to about 30 hours of training across seven courses. That's before you touch a single advanced strategy.</p>

  <p>But the key insight: <strong>you don't need all 30 hours to start earning.</strong> You need the first 51 minutes — Getting Started plus the Megalink deep-dive. After that, you understand the system well enough to share your link intelligently, not blindly.</p>
</section>

