<section id="verdict">
  <h2>Verdict: Worth 8 Minutes?</h2>

  <VerdictBox>
    <p><strong>Yes. It's the orientation you need.</strong></p>
    <p>The Getting Started course is not revolutionary. It won't teach you a growth hack or a traffic secret. But it solves the single biggest problem new OLSP members face: <strong>not knowing where to click first.</strong></p>
    <p>Eight minutes to understand the dashboard, find your link, and know what to do next is a fair trade. Skipping it means spending your first hour clicking randomly through menus and eventually giving up — which is exactly what happens to the majority of members who never earn anything.</p>
  </VerdictBox>
</section>

